<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Allstate cut by S. Barney.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Allstate cut by S. Barney.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney cut its rating on Allstate Corp to outperform from buy, a Smith Barney source said.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Ron Frank was not available for comment.</p>
<p>-- Allstate on Thursday reported fourth quarter operating earnings of $1.15 a share, compared with the First Call consensus estimate of $1.10.</p>
<p>-- Allstate closed Thursday at 63-5/8.</p>
</text>
